4927	/**
4928	 * Check if a car is off the track and apply penalties.
4929	 *
4930	 * - Uses R.isOnTrack(car.x, car.z) to determine track position
4931	 * - Off track: applies OFFROAD_FRICTION (shallow) or OFFROAD_DEEP_PENALTY (deep)
