4988	/**
4989	 * Main entry point. Called each frame during 'racing' phase.
4990	 *
4991	 * Pipeline:
4992	 *   1. Gather active cars (player + AI)
4993	 *   2. AABB broad phase → candidate pairs
4994	 *   3. SAT narrow phase → confirmed collisions
4995	 *   4. Sort by overlap depth (deepest first)
4996	 *   5. Resolve each collision (push apart + impulse + effects)
4997	 *   6. Re-check boundaries for all cars (collisions may push cars off track)
4998	 *
4999	 * Edge cases handled:
5000	 *   - Multiple simultaneous collisions: resolved in depth order, max per car = 3
5001	 *   - Very slow collisions: no sparks/sound, just positional nudging
5002	 *   - One car stationary: push ratio biased toward stationary car
