777	/**
778	 * Lerp the camera toward the player car for smooth following.
779	 *
780	 * Uses a frame-rate-independent lerp so the feel is consistent at any FPS:
781	 *   t = 1 - (1 - CAMERA_SMOOTH) ^ (dt * 60)
782	 *   camera.x += (player.x - camera.x) * t
783	 *   camera.y += (player.y + CAMERA_OFFSET_Y - camera.y) * t
